1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:04,143
The Unabomber. Inside the 18-year manhunt for Ted Kaczynski.

2
00:00:04,343 --> 00:00:05,564
The man in the cabin.

3
00:00:05,864 --> 00:00:09,827
Imagine living in a remote cabin, surrounded by forest and mountains,

4
00:00:10,507 --> 00:00:13,129
far removed from the noise of modern civilization.

5
00:00:13,429 --> 00:00:15,551
There are no crowded streets outside your door,

6
00:00:16,051 --> 00:00:17,512
no office to report to,

7
00:00:18,113 --> 00:00:19,874
no busy city to navigate,

8
00:00:20,214 --> 00:00:21,865
just the quiet of the wilderness

9
00:00:21,915 --> 00:00:24,817
and a life deliberately separated from the modern world.

10
00:00:24,877 --> 00:00:26,469
To anyone passing through the area,

11
00:00:26,519 --> 00:00:28,940
the cabin might appear unremarkable.
